units real
atom_style full

boundary p p p

pair_style lj/cut 12.0

bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style zero nocoeff
improper_style harmonic

special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.5

read_data ../../phase1B/day041_lammps_export/data.lammps

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep 0.25

thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal ebond eangle edihed eimp evdwl press


log minimize.log

reset_timestep 0

thermo 100

min_style cg

minimize 1.0e-8 1.0e-8 5000 10000

write_data minimized.data
